50 Most Common Linux Interview Questions You Must Know!

If you are preparing for Linux or DevOps interviews, you will face many of these questions.

And to be honest — these are not just interview questions, they’re real-world scenarios you deal with in daily Linux work.

Here’s a hand-picked list for you 👇

