🔸 How is the Linux file system structured?
🔸 What are file permissions and how to change them?
🔸 What’s the difference between soft link and hard link?
🔸 How does chmod command work?
🔸 How to search files in Linux?
🔸 What is a process? How do you manage processes?
🔸 How to check CPU and memory usage?
🔸 What are daemons in Linux?
🔸 How to kill a running process?
🔸 What is swap space?
🔸 How to create users and manage passwords?
🔸 What is /etc/passwd file used for?
🔸 Why do we use sudo?
🔸 How to install or upgrade packages?
🔸 Difference between apt and yum?
🔸 How to schedule jobs using cron?
🔸 What is grep and how to search using it?
🔸 How to monitor disk space using df, du?
🔸 How to mount and unmount disks?
🔸 What is tar command and how to use it for backups?
🔸 What is the Linux kernel?
🔸 Difference between process vs thread?
🔸 What are Linux signals and how to send them?
🔸 How to configure network and IP addresses?
🔸 What is iptables and how to secure Linux?
🔸 What is SSH and how to use it for remote login?
🔸 How to secure Linux servers?
